    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Thomas Byrne Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market this excellent mid-terrace property in the popular residential estate of Aston Village, just off the Termonfeckin Road on the northern edge of Drogheda.\n\nThe spacious accommodation which is in excellent condition comprises: Entrance Hall, Sitting Room, Kitchen/Dining, WC. 2 Bedrooms(Main Ensuite) and Bathroom. There is natural gas central heating and the windows are double glazed PVC. There is a driveway to front and a garden to rear.\nOverlooking a large green area, this property is within walking distance of town centre. Adjacent to shops, primary & secondary schools and on bus route. For the commuter, Dublin Airport less than 30 minutes via the M1 motorway.\n\nViewing highly recommended\n\n\nFEATURES\n•2 bedroom Mid Terrace \n•Overlooking large green area\n•Excellent condition throughout\n•Natural Gas central heating\n•Double glazed windows\n•Own driveway to front\n•On bus route and walking distance to town centre\n\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nEntrance Hall\n4.6m x 1.9mTimber floor.\n\nSitting Room\n4.1m x 3.4m\nTimber floor, attractive fireplace & TV point.\n\nKitchen/Dining\n5.3m x 3.1m\nFully fitted kitchen with timber floor & patio doors to rear garden.\n\nWC\nTimber floor.\n\nBedroom 1\n3.7m x 3.1m\nCarpet floor. built in wardrobe. Ensuite.\n\nBedroom 2 \n3.4m x 3.4m\nCarpet floor, built in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom\n1.9m x 1.9m\nLinoleum floor & tiled splashback.\n"
      },
